# PR-only periode (aktiv)

Read `docs/pr-only-period.md` and **`docs/staging-batch-policy.md`**.

## Forbidden

- `git push origin main`
- `git push origin staging`
- Merging to `main` (agents never merge prod — Jan only)
- PRs with **base `main`** for feature work (base must be **`staging`**)
- Merge to `staging` before batch is ready (< 10 commits without `batch-ready` / `hotfix` label)

## Staging batch (10 commits per deploy)

1. Branch from latest `staging`: `cursor/<beskrivelse>-9a30` or `opgave-NN-slug`
2. **Accumulate up to 10 commits** on the same branch before staging merge
3. Open **draft** PR → base **`staging`** early if useful (CI on push)
4. When batch has **10 commits** (or Jan adds `batch-ready` / `hotfix`): deliverable gate → mark **Ready for review**
5. Auto-merge to `staging` when CI green and batch policy satisfied
6. Final message: PR URL + confirm merged to `staging` (or why blocked — e.g. waiting for commit 7/10)

## Production — Jan only (hard requirement)

- **Never** merge or auto-merge **`staging` → `main`**
- Prod deploy = Jan merges release PR `staging` → `main` manually
- Do not tell Jan "deployed to prod" from agent work
- Flow 2: agent may **create** open PR `staging` → `main` when asked — never merge it

## Sonar remediation loop

Follow `.cursor/prompts/sonar-remediation-loop.md`: one commit per tick on `cursor/sonar-remediation-loop`, draft PR until **10 commits**, then ready + auto-merge to **staging only**. No prod auto-merge.
